===Red's house===
The northwest house belongs to {{ga|Red}} and {{ka|Mom|his mother}}, but Red is currently away. He defeated his neighbor and [[rival]], {{ga|Blue}}, to earn the Champion title, but gave up that role within the [[Pokémon League]] in order to continue his training. His mother is proud of him, but still worries that he is all alone somewhere.

===Blue's house===
The northeast house belongs to {{ga|Blue}} and his sister, [[Daisy Oak|Daisy]], but Blue is away as well. She reveals that her brother serves as the [[Viridian City]] [[Gym Leader]], and that his frequent traveling causes problems for the Gym's challengers.

====Spa Day with Daisy====
Speak to [[Daisy Oak|Daisy]] between 3:00 PM and 4:00 PM, and she offers to groom a single Pokémon. Grooming increases a Pokémon's [[friendship]] rating, and boosting this value is essential in order to obtain [[Friendship Evolution|certain Pokémon]]. Daisy offers her grooming service once per day.

===Professor Oak's Lab===
The large building to the south is [[Professor Oak]]'s [[Oak's Lab|laboratory]]. Speak with the professor to have him rate your [[Pokédex]] progress. He also asks that you visit again after earning all eight [[Kanto]] Gym Badges, as he will have a gift for you.



